**Given:**

dfrac{27 times (0.25)³ + 125 times (0.05)³}{(0.75)² - 0.25 times 0.5}

**Formula used:**

a³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² - ab + b²)

**Calculation:**

⇒ dfrac{(3 times 0.25)³ + (5 times 0.05)³}{0.75² - 0.25 times (0.75 - 0.25)}

⇒ dfrac{0.75³ + 0.25³}{0.75² - 0.75 times 0.25 + 0.25²}

⇒ dfrac{(0.75 + 0.25)(0.75² - 0.75 times 0.25 + 0.25²)}{0.75² - 0.75 times 0.25 + 0.25²}

⇒ 0.75 + 0.25

⇒ 1

**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**
